  "description": "Nalix.Network is the high-performance networking runtime for the Nalix ecosystem. It provides TCP, UDP, and WebSocket listeners, sharded active connection management, transport protocol lifecycle orchestration, and robust network level rate-limiting/admission control.\n\nDesigned for latency-sensitive workloads, it emphasizes efficient socket I/O, predictable concurrency, observability, and secure transport behavior so applications can process real-time traffic reliably under sustained load.",
